     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&quot;trebuchet ms&quot;,sans-serif\">​The way I do it is by predicting fitted values and plotting them over the data. I&#39;ve made a small example of <a href=\"https://rpubs.com/RomanL/6752\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://rpubs.com/RomanL/6752&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792367471179000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3xJNjuBgd5BwJhCTrUkyW6\">plotting a non-linear Michaelis-Menten</a> model​ using `drm`.</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&quot;trebuchet ms&quot;,sans-serif\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&quot;trebuchet ms&quot;,sans-serif\">Cheers,</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&quot;trebuchet ms&quot;,sans-serif\">Roman</div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Thu, Dec 15, 2016 at 1:07 PM, 高平磊 <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">gaopi...@163.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br></div></div>"
    ],
